// The rows the service reads, given to its test suite as test data. The suite
// loads them into H2, whose test data loader writes each value as it is given,
// so binary values are written as H2 hex literals.

###Data
Data demo::relation::binary::data::BinaryData
{
  Relation
  #{
    default.T:
      ID,PAYLOAD,VPAYLOAD
      1,X'0a0b',X'deadbeef'
      2,X'cafebabe',X'0102030405';
  }#
}
